OL,3,GNEWSABarn fire prompts warning to shut
OL,4,Awindows and doors
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a fire
OL,7,Fin a large barn overnight.
OL,9,FSix crews were sent to the scene off
OL,10,Fthe B480 at Stadhampton in south
OL,11,FOxfordshire after hay bales inside the
OL,12,Fbuilding went up in flames.
OL,14,FOxfordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,15,Fsaid crews worked through the night to
OL,16,Fmaintain a firebreak, protecting nearby
OL,17,Fhay bales and preventing the blaze from
OL,18,Fspreading to surrounding buildings.
OL,19,FThey are expected to remain at the
OL,20,Fscene throughout the day.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
