OL,3,GNEWSABarn fire prompts warning to shut
OL,4,Awindows and doors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fire service said the fire caused a
OL,7,Flarge smoke plume to drift north-west
OL,8,Fin the direction of Little Milton about
OL,9,Fthree miles (5km) away. Those living in
OL,10,Fthe area have been advised to keep
OL,11,Fwindows and doors closed.
